<title>BELGIUM: Al-Tayyar group opens office at Brussels airport.</title>
<headline>Al-Tayyar group opens office at Brussels airport.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Arabia's Al-Tayyar agency group has opened an office at the Brussels airport freight village (Brucargo) under the name A.T.Europe, an airport statement said.</p>
<p>Saudi Arabian Airlines, the country's national carrier, already operates freighter services to Brussels.</p>
<p>The forwarding group has 56 branches in Africa, Europe, the Middle East and the U.S., the statement added. - Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017 - www.racs.com</p>
